#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Check your understanding {#check-your-understanding-1}"
msgstr "בדוק את ההבנה שלך {#check-your-understanding-1}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Verify that the above truth table yields the correct solution for an adder "
"circuit. That is, for each of the four options of A and B, verify that "
"$A+B=S+2 \\times C$.\n"
msgstr ""

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"0+0 &= 0+0 = 0 ~\\checkmark \\\\\n"
"0+1 &= 1+0 = 1  ~\\checkmark \\\\\n"
"1+0 &= 1+0 = 1  ~\\checkmark \\\\\n"
"1+1 &= 0+2 = 2 ~\\checkmark \\\\\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"אמת שטבלת האמת הנ\"ל נותנת את הפתרון הנכון עבור Circuit מחבר. כלומר, עבור כל"
" אחת מארבע האפשרויות של A ו-B, אמת ש-$A+B=S+2 \\times C$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: dropped, JSX/HTML tags differ from English: $$
# \begin{aligned} 0+0 &= 0+0 = 0 ~\checkmark \\ 0+1 &= 1+0
