"| Input | Output |\n"
"| :------- | -------: |\n"
"| $\\vert 0\\rangle$      | $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(\\vert 0\\rangle+\\vert 1\\rangle\\right)$  |\n"
"| $\\vert 1\\rangle$  | $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(\\vert 0\\rangle-\\vert 1\\rangle\\right)$  |\n"
msgstr ""
"| קלט | פלט |\n"
"| :------- | -------: |\n"
"| $\\vert 0\\rangle$      | $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(\\vert 0\\rangle+\\vert 1\\rangle\\right)$  |\n"
"| $\\vert 1\\rangle$  | $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\left(\\vert 0\\rangle-\\vert 1\\rangle\\right)$  |\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
