"Backend ספציפי שאנחנו יודעים את תכונותיו.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There is code below for saving your credentials upon first use. Be sure to "
"delete this information from the notebook after saving it to your "
"environment, so that your credentials are not accidentally shared when you "
"share the notebook. See [Set up your IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup)"
